        "1846eb49-e4ad-4f13-aa3d-343923c0c3b8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Founded in 2017, Dumais Made is a ceramics studio that makes pieces by hand. A practice that began with lamps and has since evolved to furniture, objects, and accessories that balance form and function.<br/><br/>Because everything is made by hand, each piece possesses its own story. A story that reflects the collective of individuals that made it, their interests, ideas, and inspiration, their personality and process, even their temperament on the day.<br/><br/>It is this character that defines a piece by Dumais Made. Pieces crafted with care, that are intended to live alongside you, revealing their story along the way.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
